  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Deiphon barrandei has an inflated rounded glabella and a very narrow segmented trunk framed by long spines. Underside limbs, antennae, colour and thickness are inferred from dorsal fossil evidence, without claims about buoyancy or feeding.",
    "zh": "Deiphon barrandei 具有膨大的圆形头鞍和被长刺环绕的极窄分节躯干。腹面肢、触角、颜色及体厚由背面化石证据推断，不据此主张浮力机制或摄食方式。"
  },
